[{"client_msg_id":"452721b5-c657-49b6-880c-61a519c4c8d3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"オブジェクト指向なのがOpenGL、並行処理指向（関数型）がValkanって感じだと捉えてます。","ts":"1626271322.187100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oqG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c50b0c08-3af5-42fb-b417-9a70f5d74e00","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ゴリゴリにパフォーマンスを要求するような事がなければOpenGLでもまだ戦えそうですね。AAAタイトルなら難しいでしょうが。","ts":"1626271121.186000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kEjyK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dd68714-048f-4568-8f14-37c0ae566071","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね、Vulkanの出自の記事みたので、ニュアンスはわかります","ts":"1626270976.184800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tA66q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc749ac4-5452-4080-b684-c6b5603bdf56","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"パフォーマンスが出ないってことで API を整理し直したのが Vulkan だという理解です","ts":"1626270953.184400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xO1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f96775cc-2940-4e0c-9530-295c714d2fef","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"OpenGL のころに仮定していたモデルと今の GPU のモデルはだいぶ乖離していて、でも OpenGL は互換性のために API 変えずに今に至るかんじで","ts":"1626270930.183800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7MCy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b693f50f-33b3-4937-b9cd-e0752479a8e7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"上位、まあそうですね","ts":"1626270895.182900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ceUz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7d63673-89b0-4bf7-8d21-8f25f33a3e91","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、そういう風にリコンストラクト(再構築)されたAPIなんですね\nじゃあ必要ないか","ts":"1626270651.179800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jzK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb126f62-a47b-444e-8ae4-e5c5229b1835","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Vulkanはパフォーマンスを追求するためにグラフィックドライバと直接話す低レベルAPI、その上位としてOpenGLが乗っかっているとの事です。","ts":"1626270583.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"izFAz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38850df2-976d-4bc6-b295-c743a1d2b18d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いいと思います","ts":"1626270063.177100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"an0jo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3782c763-1d30-461e-a5a7-24b6edb870f2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"(Ebiten についていうと OpenGL2 で十分なパフォーマンスがでてしまっているのであまりやる気がないというのもある)","ts":"1626270051.176900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vTi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca6117c6-25b0-4c5d-991e-6ea9a938d344","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、まあそうか\nMSはDxで進捗してたから、あとからのVulkan対応アレなのか(しらなかったのでスマヌ)","ts":"1626270040.176600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QMUq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecbedcc2-f7c0-415d-9b2c-2f30e1330e47","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"まあ多分どれも似たような…ものではあるが…多分…","ts":"1626269990.175800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iva2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fed78328-f503-45ac-93e8-9ac0ba62801d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Vulkan に統一しようぜという動きは MS と Apple のやる気の無さで頓挫","ts":"1626269946.175300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tsurai_orange","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jn3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d292f813-504a-4728-a2a3-9b40870c7d4a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"プロプライエタリだった気がする","ts":"1626269