ocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iEy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"071f5291-eac9-48a1-ae0f-bcc7a878c8ed","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ツクールのウィンドウ周りの仕様がガバくてiOSで動かすとクラッシュすることがある（デスクトップでもウィンドウ開閉すると重くなる）\nでも実装から直すのがむずい\nみたいなのもあったな、あんな感じかも","ts":"1626236525.131900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FyL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4850334b-73aa-42f5-888f-b8520cf52b01","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"おいしいんですよ…","ts":"1626236432.130900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sfcx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b42aa91-8608-49df-aca7-8b10c57d5d8d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"インターフェースなにそれおいしいの的な水準だと思われます","ts":"1626236422.130700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PN1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c14b11a8-8662-4fe3-a360-48e1f06c1591","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"interface が綺麗に切られていれば implementation は多少汚くても良い、と思っていますが、そもそも interface が汚いレベルだとどうしようもない","ts":"1626236397.130300","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1626236407.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f56ax"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a6d5b1c-a1ee-4069-a90b-28c629b6a02b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「ゲームプログラマになる前に覚えておきたい技術」には、捨てる想定で試作品を作れ！と書いてありました\n（なおそれが捨てられずに実用されてしまうとも）","ts":"1626236372.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92f41fb8-0eae-44c9-a9f9-b8583a3689ea","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"綺麗なコードを書くの、できるならみんなやっとるわ、みたいな話なのかな","ts":"1626236295.128600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l77WC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"797006