UVMBJR","text":"ベッタベタにプラットフォームに依存したコードを作ってしまうのはありそう","ts":"1626236152.125000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pOdP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17f026b8-6987-4046-a8b5-895a6428e806","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"はい、汚いコードってのはそういうこと込みなきがします","ts":"1626236116.124400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVTo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dba22476-ad99-4c41-be97-28dab5b0bd6c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"プラットフォーム依存部分とそうでない部分の境界を曖昧にしてしまった、とかだと移植困難かもしれない","ts":"1626236097.124100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xep"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d11b535-5fea-41c7-876b-39929749c7fe","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"他人が書いたひどいコードの読解がつらかったとかの話かなーとぼんやり","ts":"1626235775.123500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aGu1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e49e95a1-7af9-43ed-a782-c8bbcf46d674","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"いずれにせよコードが汚い云々の話ではなさそうですね","ts":"1626235714.123100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1587b826-f552-4c73-b04d-dd15723caf49","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u0026gt; メモリ帯域は理論値で3.2GB/秒に達する。","ts":"1626235711.123000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kmc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a097955-aacb-404b-93d9-3dac3151e23c","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"PS2はマジヤバいで有名ですよね…","ts":"1626235674.122300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a744b229-de3a-4cce-bb2a-32a17a13d55e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"PS2はアーキテクチャが尖りすぎてて移植がめっちゃ辛かったはず（PS3で動作しなかったのもそれ）",