として汚いコードで移植に困るってのは確かにゲームエンジンとかを使っていればそうそう起きない気もしますね。まあでも kyubuns さんの身に何かあったんだろうな…こういうのって大抵経験談だし","ts":"1626235265.118800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ISuf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CB440ABB-49CF-4275-B704-CE7AF7191D83","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"コーディング面ではなかったなあ","ts":"1626235130.117400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4+Pz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FDDC36D3-6A66-49F6-A5F7-05848E42E3E0","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"移植にもいろいろあるけどunityで作ってた知人がマルチプラットフォーム対応で一番苦労してたのはスペック差だった","ts":"1626235120.117000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPnA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c176923f-7150-4b2b-a3b6-ef91541d57ae","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"(ツクールは家庭用ゲーム機への移植が困難だと言われている)","ts":"1626234520.115800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+2uZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdee9de5-586d-4631-a9f2-724b07507fdb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ツクールみたいな極端な例を除けば、今どき移植に困るような書き方って普通しなくないですか?","ts":"1626234464.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VX5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b09337ff-d712-4479-8056-44fa27e446d4","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ある意味「美的センス」が問われるって感じですね。ユニ○ロでも着こなし上手い人はそれを思わせないように着こなしますし。","ts":"1626232351.114800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iqz8R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f4e966-e3d6-4c55-b363-840254fa3ee8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あとは単純に綺麗なコードを書くのには相応の実力が必要と言う話はある…","ts":"1626232276.113600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z7Lbt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc9df1f-c088-4218-b26f-ae9b34213bad","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"それこそ初期の無○良品みたいな考えでやるとエターナる確率がめちゃくちゃ高くなる…。","ts":"1626232190.113100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4656"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aff5a6be-9be6-47cc-992b-65d67b5c76c6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"本当に捨てない限りは何が起きるかわからないですよねw","ts":"1626232103.112400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZJJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb65cb16-770f-4d11-bf8e-e4f455687275","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"仕事であれば:moneybag:がモチベになりますが、個人開発の場合だと何に軸を置くかで変わってきますからね…。","ts":"1626232087.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"21J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1e3e6c0-2947-4e8d-b0ca-9a78d671e4d9","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u0026gt; 3 ヶ月とかで作って後はメンテもいらない\nこの手のコード、だいたい忘れた頃に修正依頼飛んでくるのでアレすぎる…","ts":"1626230328.111000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FZ2CV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f095c239-511e-4a28-af6d-056d9d5fd072","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"3 ヶ月とかで作って後はメンテもいらない、とかであれば書き捨てコードでもまあいいけど、そうでないなら多少時間かけてでもきれいなコードにした方が最終的には時間節約できると思う","ts":"1626230147.110200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r6h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e291b2e1-716f-4d87-9486-9d3cb88c084b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"世に出なければなんの価値も生まない","ts":"1626229980.109200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mZqER"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b9907eb-cc22-45d8-a6e0-a54cf56dc0b5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグイン開発でも同じような問題がありますね。完成させるのは大変…。","ts":"1626229966.108700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s3k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"add79ce2-fd0a-4839-b108-27c04d8c469d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"その「エタらない程度」ってのが実務5年やってますが未だに掴めない…。","ts":"1626229754.108000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XZV4/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67a8bae9-0c38-4619-9dde-eb7d2d9d4fe6","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"エタらない程度に意識する事は大切ですが、あんまり意識しすぎるとしんどくなる…どの事でも言えますが。","ts":"1626229589.107300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N61IC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"799cfe23-7645-45a3-89e5-6d74aa8c6ee6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんも整備してないザ泥なコードでくちだけを回避しても、それこそなにも不具合修正不可能になるレベルはやばいしね","ts":"1626229454.106500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ITbXu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ecf19e4-2ec8-4ca3-a062-bf35471bdff3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"上のを好意的にかつ現実に解釈すると、適時のリファクタでそこそこのラインを維持してリリースしつつもうちょっとリファクタして綺麗にしておけば、不具合修正や機能強化、移植に備えられるよね、くらいのラインかなと思った","ts":"1626229426.105800","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1626229626.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DCGn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"216b6665-2d50-44b8-934f-dfb1a26c01a5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"確かにリファクタリングも相当コストかかるけど、まず泥臭く動くものを出さないと口だけ番長になっちゃいますしね。","ts":"1626229325.104600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qq=d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30a914e1-1959-4a04-b811-5102cf4d7667","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なお、ツイートしてるのはリアル知り合いだった模様","ts":"1626229224.103400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lEy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61e681c9-0b99-4712-b46e-6a399f40b34a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そもそも「移植しましょう」と声かかるゲームの方が圧倒的に少ないから。","ts":"1626229161.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hojda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4414acf2-f45e-4876-aa4f-2a03a7136a5f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、時間があるときにリファクタリングできるといいですね…(遠い目","ts":"1626229083.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"spQXo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9780e09d-73f2-4ab3-b765-ce4cded9172c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やかましいわ。キレイなコードを意識してたらエターナるんじゃ。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/kyubuns/status/1414607854057574400\u003e","ts":"1626229015.101500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kyubuns|@kyubuns\u003e: ゲーム開発において「綺麗なコードが金を生むわけではない」は正しいが、\n人気が出て「こっちのプラットフォームにも移植しよう！あっちのプラットフォームにも！」となったときにコストが安く移植できて金を生むのは綺麗なコードであるから、\n「汚いコードは金を生むチャンスを潰す」と言っていこう。","id":1,"author_name":"きゅぶんず","author_subname":"@kyubuns","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kyubuns/status/1414607854057574400","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1175369895044775937/3jrWjbiQ_normal.jpg","text":"ゲーム開発において「綺麗なコードが金を生むわけではない」は正しいが、\n人気が出て「こっちのプラットフォームにも移植しよう！あっちのプラットフォームにも！」となったときにコストが安く移植できて金を生むのは綺麗なコードであるから、\n「汚いコードは金を生むチャンスを潰す」と言っていこう。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626103769,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kyubuns/status/1414607854057574400","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kyubuns/status/1414607854057574400"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7dAk"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U016GRZN0GJ","text":"\u003c@U016GRZN0GJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626198352.100500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
